data: {"id": "05640c2cce7149b1-thinking-parallel_evidence-1168", "run_id": "05640c2cce7149b1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 仍存在于 API Server 且处于 Terminating**：YAML 中 `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-07T23:09:46Z`，距今已约 50 分钟，远超 `terminationGracePeriodSeconds=10` 和 `deletionGracePeriodSeconds=0`。\n2. **存在自定义 finalizer 阻止删除**：`metadata.finalizers: [aiops.lab/hold]`。这是 Kubernetes 删除对象的阻塞机制——只要 finalizer 未清除，API Server 不会真正移除对象。\n3. **容器以 SIGKILL 退出**：`exitCode=137` (SIGKILL)，`restarts=0`，说明容器在删除请求后收到了 kill 信号但未能完成清理（被 finalizer 拦截）。\n4. **所在 Node Ready**：`node2` 状态为 `Ready`，kubelet 正常运行，排除了节点失联导致的 Terminating。\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788825583155, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

